---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Enterprise Data Quality Framework | Case Study">
	<article class="case-study-page">
		<header class="cs-hero container section-padding">
			<a href="/#case-studies" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Case Studies</a>
			<span class="category">Data Governance & Quality</span>
			<h1 class="text-gradient">Enterprise Data Quality Framework</h1>
			<p class="cs-subtitle">Building trust through rigorous governance and transparent data lineage.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="cs-image-banner">
			<img src="/images/project_dataquality.png" alt="Data Quality Framework" />
		</div>

		<section class="container section-padding cs-content">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div class="main-body">
					<h2 class="gold-accent">The Challenge</h2>
					<p>
						In complex enterprise environments, the lack of rigorous data validation and clear lineage often leads to a deficit of trust. Downstream users, from analysts to C-suite executives, struggle to rely on Business Intelligence reporting when the underlying data governance is weak or non-existent.
					</p>

					<h2 class="gold-accent">The Solution</h2>
					<p>
						I championed comprehensive data governance and validation frameworks across the enterprise architecture. By integrating Medallion architecture principles and adhering strictly to best practices in metadata management, I established robust validation checks at every stage of the ETL pipeline. Furthermore, I created transparent documentation and intricate data flow diagrams to map exact data lineage.
					</p>

					<h2 class="gold-accent">The Impact</h2>
					<p>
						The implementation of this enterprise-wide quality framework fundamentally transformed how data is consumed. It fostered a strong culture of data-driven decision-making by significantly enhancing trust and compliance. Ultimately, this governance allowed the business to safely scale its managed self-service Business Intelligence capabilities without compromising data integrity.
					</p>
				</div>
				<aside class="cs-sidebar glass">
					<h3>Expertise</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Data Governance</li>
						<li>Medallion Architecture</li>
						<li>Metadata Management</li>
						<li>Data Lineage Mapping</li>
						<li>Validation Frameworks</li>
					</ul>
					<h3>Focus Area</h3>
					<p>Enterprise Data Architecture</p>
				</aside>
			</div>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.case-study-page {
		min-height: 100vh;
	}

	.cs-hero {
		padding-bottom: 4rem;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 900px;
	}

	.back-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-weight: 500;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		color: var(--accent-gold);
	}

	.category {
		display: block;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.cs-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	.cs-image-banner {
		width: 100%;
		max-height: 60vh;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
	}

	.cs-image-banner img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
	}

	.content-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
		gap: 4rem;
	}

	.main-body h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-top: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.main-body h2:first-child {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.main-body p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.cs-sidebar {
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		height: fit-content;
		position: sticky;
		top: 120px;
	}

	.cs-sidebar h3 {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.cs-sidebar ul {
		list-style: none;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.cs-sidebar ul li {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.cs-sidebar ul li::before {
		content: '▹';
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
	}

	.cs-sidebar p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	@media (max-width: 992px) {
		.content-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.cs-sidebar {
			position: static;
		}
	}
</style>
